SOAPBOX: Only my second CQWW SSB but trying Single Band 20m instead of All Band. Started on the Saturday 05:45 UTC and last contact was before 21:00 UTC. Mostly S&P but one good Run for 90 minutes in the afternoon. Sunday was fewer hours still starting before 06:00 UTC. Couldn't delpoy the Delta Loop due to high winds so limited to the DX Commander Signature 9 until 18:00UTC. No significant Run time but really glad of the last 60 mins to bag 8 US/Caribbean 3 pointers and 2 new mults.
